ель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?version=1.20.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-4.svg\" alt=\"1.20.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?version=1.20.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-2.svg\" alt=\"1.20.2\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?version=1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-1.svg\" alt=\"1.20.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?version=1.19.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-19-4.svg\" alt=\"1.19.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?version=1.19.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-19-2.svg\" alt=\"1.19.2\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?version=1.18.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-18-2.svg\" alt=\"1.18.2\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"Загрузчик\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/server.svg\" alt=\"Серверный\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"Баг-трекер\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/pyrotechnic-elytra/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>Описание</strong></h2>\n<p>Летите куда угодно и устраивайте фейерверк для всех вокруг!<br>\nТеперь для ускорения полета можно использовать ракетные фейерверки любого цвета, эффекта или формы!</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/pyrotechnic-elytra/day-flight.gif\" alt=\"Дневной полет\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/pyrotechnic-elytra/night-flight.gif\" alt=\"Ночной полет\"></p>\n<h2><strong>Зависимости</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Мод</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Загрузчик</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Требование</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Все</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Обязательно</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><strong>Лицензия и права использования</strong></h2>\n<p>Не стесняйтесь использовать этот шаблон мода для любых модов, просто обязательно укажите автора и, возможно, дайте ссылку <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/pyrotechnic-elytra#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">здесь</a>.<br>\nЭтот проект опубликован под <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/pyrotechnic-elytra/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest Community License v1</a>.</p>\n<h2><strong>Поддержать нас</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Сайт Crystal Nest\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"Наши другие проекты\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forgan